### Listing written messages — GET /api/v1/messages
# The signed-in person's texts still waiting to be read or being read. Only state=READING is accepted, and the
# answer is empty or holds the one text the person has in that state. Needs an open session; no CSRF token, since
# it is a read.

@host = http://localhost:1000
# Set from the fb_session cookie a sign-in response sets — see ../session/sign-in.http.
@sessionCookie = paste-the-fb_session-cookie-value-here

### The texts waiting to be read or being read.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/messages?state=READING
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}
